["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SimpleLicensing/customIdToUri", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "**DEPRECATED in SPDX 3.1.**\nUse [customIdToLicense](./customIdToLicense.md) instead.\n\nMaps a LicenseRef or AdditionRef string for a Custom License or a Custom\nLicense Addition to its URI ID.\n\n**NOTE:**\nThis property is deprecated and only included for backward compatibility.\nNew documents should use [customIdToLicense](./customIdToLicense.md) instead.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/AI/limitation", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty", "globalId", "", ""]
